    "intro_html":  "This is the loaded baked potato that grew up and became dinner: crispy seasoned potatoes, juicy chicken, and a topping of cheddar, bacon, and green onion with cool sour cream on the side. A monster \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e per serving for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Big portions, big flavor, small receipt.",
